4
00:00:07.103 --> 00:00:08.917
The strong version says language

5
00:00:08.917 --> 00:00:10.278
determines thought.

6
00:00:10.278 --> 00:00:11.414
The weak version,

7
00:00:11.414 --> 00:00:12.604
now more accepted,

8
00:00:12.604 --> 00:00:14.736
says it influences thought.

9
00:00:15.072 --> 00:00:16.819
Whorf argued that the Hopi

10
00:00:16.819 --> 00:00:19.217
language treats time differently from

11
00:00:19.217 --> 00:00:22.565
English. Later research questioned that.

12
00:00:23.241 --> 00:00:25.510
The topic also covers non-verbal

13
00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:27.645
